<title>HONG KONG: Legend half-year net loss HK$68.95 mln.</title>
<headline>Legend half-year net loss HK$68.95 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   9.1 loss   vs  5.3 gain</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	  vs  1.5</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  15.20 loss vs  nil</p>
<p>    Net			    68.95 loss vs  36.89 profit</p>
<p>    Turnover		     1,596.99   vs  1,971.42</p>
<p>    Company name		 Legend Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Legend Holdings is a computer products manufacturer and distributor.</p>
<p>The exceptional item represents expenses incurred in connection with the group's operational realignment, which mainly comprised restructing and removal expenses.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
